# VICE-specific config overrides (deltas only).
# Merged over data/config by tools/deploy-vice.sh before assembling the disk.
# Only keys that differ from the hardware default belong here; everything else
# (BBS_NAME, SYSOP_NAME, devices, ...) stays single-sourced in data/config.
#
# NOTE: 19200 and 38400 program the SAME 6551 ACIA register (0x1F). VICE runs
# that register at 19200, the U64 at 38400 — so BAUD_RATE here is cosmetic
# (the number CONFIGURE/WFC shows). MODEM_TYPE=VICE is functional: it forces
# AT-string carrier detection from boot instead of AUTO's DSR-then-flip path.
BAUD_RATE=19200
MODEM_TYPE=VICE
